# CONTEXT.md — SCE 102 Lab 11: Structures

## Domain: C Structs and Pointers

### Core types

**`struct car`** — a vehicle record used across exercises L1101–L1105.
- `char color[50]` — color name (max 50 chars)
- `float maxSpeed` — maximum speed
- `float weight` — vehicle weight (engine weight + frame weight in L1105)
- `float fuelTank` — fuel tank capacity
- `int carType` — car type identifier (1 or 2 in L1105)

**`struct card`** — a playing card used in L11O1.
- `int point` — card value 1–13
- `char symbol` — suit character A/B/C/D (ASCII 65–68)

