### L1105 constants

Engines:
| Engine | maxSpeed | weight |
|--------|----------|--------|
| A | 160.0 | 395.0 |
| B | 110.0 | 250.8 |
| C | 184.63 | 535.64 |

Car types (frame + fuel tank added to engine values):
| Type | frame weight | fuel tank |
|------|-------------|-----------|
| 1 | 529.8 | 44.32 |
| 2 | 633.4 | 57.46 |

Final car weight = engine weight + type frame weight. Final fuel tank = type fuel tank.
Colors: randomly from {Black, White, Red, Blue}.
If quantity < 5: display all. If >= 5: display first 5 only.

### L11O1 card formula
`card_value` (0–51): `point = card_value % 13 + 1`, `symbol = card_value / 13 + 65` (A=65, B=66, C=67, D=68).
Display format: `point+symbol` (e.g., "13D"), 5 cards separated by spaces.

### Output format conventions
- Header text on its own line
- Separator of dashes on next line (14 for "properties", 30 for section headers, 22 for "Car Assembly Line")
- Each field on its own line: `Color = %s`, `Max Speed = %.2f`, `Weight = %.2f`, `Fuel Tank = %.2f`, `Car Type = %d`
